rdiseerde vanaf 19 mei 2022 de aanduidingen voor twee soorten hot spots","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The date and the two categories match the source; “aanduidingen” conveys the standardized meanings/symbols in context.","materiality":"The date and number of categories define the scope and timing of the standardization."},{"excerpt":"Een cirkel of ellips staat voor een ground movement hot spot","claim":"Een cirkel of ellips duidt een ground movement hot spot aan.","category":"technical","label":"F0","evidence":"A circle or ellipse marks a ground movement hot spot.","narrative":"een cirkel of ellips duidt een ground movement hot spot aan","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The symbol-to-category mapping matches the source.","materiality":"This is one of the standard’s specific symbol meanings."},{"excerpt":"een cilinder duidt een wrong surface hot spot aan.","claim":"Een cilinder duidt een wrong surface hot spot aan.","category":"technical","label":"F0","evidence":"a cylinder marks a wrong surface hot spot.","narrative":"een cilinder duidt een wrong surface hot spot aan","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The symbol-to-category mapping matches the source.","materiality":"This is one of the standard’s specific symbol meanings."},{"excerpt":"De vorm op de kaart maakt zichtbaar om welk type het gaat.","claim":"De vorm op de kaart maakt zichtbaar welk type hot spot is aangeduid.","category":"technical","label":"F0","evidence":"A circle or ellipse marks a ground movement hot spot; a cylinder marks a wrong surface hot spot.","narrative":"de vorm op de kaart maakt zichtbaar om welk type het gaat","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source’s distinct shapes identify the two meanings, supporting this summary.","materiality":"This states the practical relationship between the symbols and the hot spot types."},{"excerpt":"Die standaardise